            "heading": "Features & experience",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/product-characteristics-icon_b10c6a41-572f-447e-8d84-56f4609057fc.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>MIA™ 3</strong> is designed for users who want pleasure that feels both <strong>discreet and effortlessly accessible</strong>. Its standout quality is its lipstick-inspired design, which makes it look elegant, minimal, and easy to carry without attracting attention. Combined with <strong>nearly silent vibrations</strong>, it offers a more private and flexible experience that fits naturally into everyday routines and travel.</p><p>Its ultra-soft exterior adds to the experience by creating a warmer, smoother feel against the body, while the compact size makes it especially convenient for spontaneous use. Whether kept in a handbag, taken on a trip, or simply enjoyed at home, <strong>MIA™ 3</strong> is made to deliver satisfying stimulation in a way that feels subtle, stylish, and easy to enjoy.</p>{{ block.settings.page.content }}",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_PQya4J": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product information",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/product-info-icon_a8db015b-ddf4-4acd-97f6-bcb1fc623814.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>MIA™ 3</strong> is made from <strong>ABS and food-grade silicone</strong> with a matte finish that feels soft and elegant in the hand. It measures <strong>22 x 22 x 111 mm / 0.87 x 0.87 x 4.37 in</strong>, weighs <strong>36 g / 1.27 oz</strong>, and is designed to be compact enough to fit easily into even small bags. It is powered by a <strong>Li-Ion 70 mAh 3.7 V battery</strong> and charges in <strong>up to 2 hours at 5.0 V 70 mA</strong>.</p><p>The device offers <strong>up to 1.5 hours of use</strong>, <strong>90 days of standby time</strong>, a <strong>maximum noise level below 60 dB</strong>, and a simple <strong>2-button interface</strong>. To use it, charge it fully before first use, unlock it if needed by pressing and holding the <strong>+</strong> and <strong>–</strong> buttons for 3 seconds, then press the <strong>+</strong> button briefly to turn it on. Double-click the <strong>+</strong> or <strong>–</strong> button to switch between <strong>8 modes</strong>, and turn it off by pressing the <strong>–</strong> button briefly at level 1 or holding it at other levels.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CDVNV9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/why-youll-love-it-icon_cfeb8990-ada5-4667-b824-aee5a0ca42cc.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One of the standout qualities of <strong>MIA™ 3</strong> is its ability to combine <strong>discretion, portability, and elegance</strong> in one beautifully compact device. It is ideal for users who want something small enough to carry anywhere, yet refined enough to feel premium and enjoyable every time they use it. The lipstick-style look makes it especially appealing for those who value privacy and a more understated design.</p><p>Its quiet performance, soft-touch finish, and rechargeable convenience also make it practical for regular use without feeling bulky or complicated. Stylish, simple, and easy to take anywhere, <strong>MIA™ 3</strong> is a great choice for anyone looking for a discreet pleasure device that fits seamlessly into daily life.</p>",
